--- source:handler-guide
slug: handler-guide
kind: guide
title: Handler guide
locator: "https://example.org/handlers@v1.2.0"
attribution: The handlers team
--- decision:imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
slug: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
title: Imported from Handler guide at v1.2.0
text: The rules were drafted from the guide at its tag and cite it by section.
who: "Ada <ada@example.org>"
date: "2026-11-08"
--- rule:go.style.2
id: go.style.2
statement: "Handler guide"
strength: should
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#handler-guide"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.3
id: go.style.3
statement: "Handlers MUST log once per request."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#logging"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.4
id: go.style.4
statement: "Handlers MUST NOT log secrets."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#logging"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.5
id: go.style.5
statement: "Handlers SHOULD log at the edge."
strength: should
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#logging"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.6
id: go.style.6
statement: "An error MUST be wrapped with context."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#errors"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.7
id: go.style.7
statement: "An error MUST be handled once."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#errors"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.8
id: go.style.8
statement: "A retry MUST be bounded."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#retries"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.9
id: go.style.9
statement: "A retry MAY use jitter."
strength: may
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#retries"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.10
id: go.style.10
statement: "Every call MUST carry a deadline."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#timeouts"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.11
id: go.style.11
statement: "A deadline MUST come from the caller and SHOULD be short."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#timeouts"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.12
id: go.style.12
statement: "Exported names MUST NOT stutter."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#naming"
    backs: rule
--- rule:go.style.13
id: go.style.13
statement: "Test names MUST say the case."
strength: must
status: proposed
origin: imported
reasoning:
  decision: imported-handler-guide-v1-2-0
sources:
  - ref: handler-guide
    where: "#naming"
    backs: rule
